{"id":"chudom","lemma":"чудом","pos":"adv","rank":3847,"glosses":["miraculously"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/21/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я как будто чудом спасся.","en":"I was saved as if by a miracle.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,{"g":"to save oneself","l":"спастись"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"kind of, quasi"]]},{"text":"Ребёнок чудом выздоровел.","en":"The child miraculously recovered.","words":[{"g":"child"},null,null]},{"text":"Его выздоровление было чудом.","en":"It was a miracle that he recovered.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"recovery"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я чудом остался жив.","en":"I narrowly escaped death.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"}]},{"text":"Я чудом избежал смерти.","en":"I narrowly escaped death.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to avoid","l":"избежать"},{"g":"death","l":"смерть"}]}]}